-- Crumb fix (2026-11-16), category_towns part: delete the 1,570
-- category_towns rows whose category page (/{trade}/{state}/{city}/) exists
-- in neither the live repo nor the generator's build tree. In the renderer
-- a category_towns row is the ONLY signal that the category page exists:
-- renderListing builds catSet from this table and the About block's
-- "More {trade} nearby" line links every filtered town's category page.
-- There is no per-row flag analogous to crumb_linked, so deleting the row
-- is the correction: the 404 link disappears and the filter-then-slice
-- rail promotes the next-nearest towns whose pages DO exist (the line is
-- omitted when fewer than two remain, the designed behavior). No row whose
-- target is in the construction set is touched, so no working link is
-- removed. Deletes are keyed on the full primary key per the d1-deltas
-- convention.

